    mission: {
      kicker: "WHAT IS PETLOG",
      title: "From records to memories,\none app for a pet's life.",
      lead: "PETLOG is a pet life-cycle platform that keeps a pet's whole life in one account: from the day it joins the family, through growth, health and daily life, to old age and the memories after farewell. Today it runs as a records, health and family-care app for dog and cat owners; building on those records, it plans to widen step by step into care services, shopping, safety and shelter links.",
      valuesTitle: "Five values PETLOG keeps",
      body: [
        "Care — so small changes are not missed. Steady meal, walk, weight and medication records help owners notice changes in condition first.",
        "Connection — with family, close to the records. Families care from the same records, and future information and services stay close to them.",
        "Lifetime — from first meeting to last goodbye. The changing needs of the early months, adult years and old age, on one life record.",
        "Trust — checked information and clear rules. No diagnosis, ads kept apart from information, and no record shared without the owner's consent.",
        "Accessibility — easy for everyone. Large text and simple screens, so even first-time owners find the app easy.",
      ],
    },
